# Fab Haus — Architecture & Fabrication Landing Page

Build specification for a static, single-page website for **Fab Haus**, a Bengaluru design-and-build firm (architecture, interiors, prefab/LGSF construction and its own modular factory, FH_Modulars). Page structure and interaction style follow https://www.rakinteriors.com/ (layout only). **Content comes from the Fab Haus Master Catalogue 2026** (client-supplied). Anything the catalogue does not contain stays a bracketed placeholder.


